<title>LATVIA: VALMIERA H1 PROFIT 416,050 LATS.</title>
<headline>VALMIERA H1 PROFIT 416,050 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange said on Monday that Valmiera Glassfibre made a profit of 416,050 lats in the first half of the year on net turnover of 5.17 million lats.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that the company's first-half gross profit was 1.57 million lats and that its profit before extraordinary items and tax was 791,041 lats.</p>
<p>The company also had sales expenses of 224,453 lats and administrative expenses of 495,788 lats.</p>
<p>Its assets came to 14.24 million lats and it had short-term debts of 1.06 million lats and no long-term debts.</p>
<p>Valmiera has German company Glasseiden Oschatz GmbH as major strategic investor.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
